क्षम + .{@-मम्@}
—1 Propriety, fitness.
—2 Battle, war.

क्षारणम्, -णा + .{@-णम्@}
—1 Converting to alkali or ashes.
—2 Distilling.

क्षयण + .{@-णः@}
—1 A place with calm water.
—2 A bay or harbour.

क्षवकम् + .{@-विका@}
—1 A species of rice.
—2 A woman.
